17h45m08s196.png", "id": "963346795761478", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391934_963346799094811_892296290153043650_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wAV5xi_tfQYQ7kNvwFWLrOC&_nc_oc=AdqFHyD61Blrjx95pv61RRouS6SB-vK8fAIhZ8ljlX3J2CXEFR4rV42XwwSzKbVrj5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9vkkYFgU_-nQRa8oCCI-JWY2wQHfgNBN2kYJF9_i1hnw&oe=6A3951C8"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-02-03-17h40m50s433.png", "id": "635622445647915", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473398258_635622448981248_3438246790668467954_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xnQEZ30JugAQ7kNvwEOUeg4&_nc_oc=AdoF-chb4MhUt7dulZuVBVJg8rliQ6XLp0t8CRT80oWGpICDnpckE-uIdGuh5aop5RA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_IwgegipmwRPQ9a7Rt6WuXbLFBLR2nueB22sgxU3qcag&oe=6A395696"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Certified HVAC Associate", "keywords": ["HVAC", "ImmerseLearn", "VR", "Training"], "long_description": "Certified HVAC Associate is a comprehensive VR training app designed to provide hands-on experience in HVAC fundamentals. This interactive simulation covers:\n\n- Fire Extinguisher Essentials: Learn proper handling and usage.\n- Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) \u2013 Understand safety best practices.\n- Basic Tools & Equipment: Master essential HVAC tools.\n- Copper Tubing Essentials: Explore cutting, bending, and joining techniques.\n- Refrigeration System & Refrigerator: Understand system components and operation.\n- Electrical Components & Controls: Learn wiring and troubleshooting.\n- Wiring Diagram Interpretation: Develop skills in reading and applying diagrams.\n\nTrain in a risk-free, realistic environment that enhances learning and skill retention. Whether you're an aspiring technician or an industry professional, this app prepares you for real-world HVAC scenarios. Start your training today!", "short_description"